## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## The name itself is fixed in Main.lua.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB's MailerExtension|r 0.4.1
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: The mail window has an inbox and a page to write on, and nothing else. This adds the two boxes that are missing. Drafts: a third tab in the mail window, beside Inbox and Send. Put an unfinished letter away with everything on it -- addressee, subject, body, attached items and gold -- and take it out again later. Works in both the keyboard and the gamepad interface, and everything it does is also on /pbmail. Sent: every letter you send is written down as it goes -- the game keeps no copy and the API cannot read one -- so you can look back at what you sent, and put any of it back on the page to send again. How many each box holds is a setting, up to a thousand each. Nothing is sent by the add-on itself; you always press Send yourself.
## Version: 0.4.1
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsMailerExtension_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Main.lua
Compose.lua
Box.lua
Drafts.lua
Sent.lua
UI.lua
Gamepad.lua
Keyboard.lua
Settings.lua

